message.content:
{
  "action": "transmit_interview",
  "words": "Station, this is Hanson. Clear the line. I have a priority audio feed for Pittsburgh. Cut the commercial break. Send the reel to the daughter.",
  "intention": "Ensure the recording of Alma’s voice reaches her daughter in Pittsburgh before the regional line closes for the night.",
  "detail": "I plug the patch cable from the Rialto console into the station’s transmission jack. My hands are steady. I do not look at the ballroom doors. I do not listen to the music drifting in from the next room. I only watch the signal light turn green, confirming the audio is routing out. Once the light is steady, I release the plug and step back. The job is done. The rest is not my concern."
}
